Package: kavel
Type: Package
Title: Generate AI Images with No API Key
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kavel", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@kavel.ai")
Description: A small client for the Kavel AI image service <https://www.kavel.ai>.
    Without a key it uses the anonymous free tier, so the first call works on a
    machine with nothing configured. With an API key every call runs on your
    kavel.ai account.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://www.kavel.ai, https://github.com/hanshs474/kavel-r
BugReports: https://github.com/hanshs474/kavel-r/issues
Imports: curl, jsonlite
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
